## Visual / layout engine

**OpenAI-inspired fluid grid is the source of truth** (`deepdose-openai-grid.css`) — **sitewide**:

- One proportional column: `--oai-page-pad` + `--oai-page-max` (app) / `--oai-page-max-wide` (marketing)
- Auto-fit grids: `.dd-oai-auto-2|3|4` and 12-col `.dd-oai-grid`
- Product shell wraps content in `dd-oai-container` + `dd-oai-stack` via `ProductAppShell`
- Public + patient + clinical + enterprise use `DeepDoseShell variant="light"` (`seco-shell--light`)

**Light Flow shell everywhere** (splash, marketing, product). Tokens in `deepdose-product-space.css` — no raw hex in feature CSS. No dark ambient on public routes.

| Layer | Tokens |
|---|---|
| Layout | `--oai-page-pad`, `--oai-gap*`, `--oai-min-*` |
| Spacing | `--dd-inset`, `--dd-gap`, `--dd-stack` |
| Ink / surface | `--dd-ink*`, `--dd-surface*`, `--dd-border*` |
| Accent | `--dd-accent`, `--dd-cue-*` — borders/fills only, **never text** |

## Copy

- No waffle. Titles live in `AppTopBar` only.
- **Text color (OpenAI rule):** black, grey, or white on dark — never yellow/teal/spectrum on readable text.
- Positioning: first social network for chemical phenotypes + human connection.
- Promise: **Discover your chemical phenotype. Find your people.**
- Value prop: **Who is online in my biological window right now?** — not “what is my score today?”
- Homepage hero: **Chemistry That Connects.** Loop CVP: **Make chemistry work.** Loop: **Screen. Score. Share. Sync.**
- Dose cards: phenotype hashtag + score badge + Sync / Synced count.
- Dose: stamp photo into a phenotype feed — no captions.
- Consumer metric = **SRI** as phenotype stability (screened from signup; scored as chemical reputation). Badge chrome may still say Score.
